"releaseNotes":"This major update brings video and more secure audio calling to the Watch, a host of platform fixes and modernizations that improves the accuracy and power efficiency of alerts, and full iOS 27 and watchOS 27 compatibility. We hope it's worth the wait!", "trackId":1474130809, "trackName":"BoundaryCare Watch-Based GPS", "genreIds":["6013", "6012"], "releaseDate":"2020-03-28T07:00:00Z", "sellerName":"Beatrice Health LLC", "currentVersionReleaseDate":"2026-10-13T18:33:27Z", "version":"1.34", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"BoundaryCare improves the independence and safety of vulnerable individuals, ranging from aging in place to cognitive or developmental issues (like Alzheimer’s or other dementias, ASD, Down syndrome, and ALS). Designed to keep caregivers in the loop and provide the tools they need to keep their loved ones safe and healthy, BoundaryCare is the only app using the Apple Watch’s top-flight capabilities to power alerts and other information to caregivers’ iPhones and their other devices.\n\n**FEATURES**\n\n**Fall Detection**\nRely on theApple Watch’s industry-leading fall detection technology, with BoundaryCare alerting caregivers instantly when a fall is detected – and helping caregivers decide what to do next.\n\n**Geofencing and Location Updates**\nSet up safe boundaries for your loved ones and receive prompt notifications when those boundaries are crossed. With real-time location tracking, you can always know where your loved ones are, reducing the risks associated with wandering or elopement.\n\n**Health Metrics**\nKeep an eye on health vitals like heart rate, blood oxygen (with supported Apple Watches), sleep quality, and activity levels. Caregivers can receive alerts about any sudden changes that might need further attention.\n\n**Reminders and Messages**\nSchedule reminders and messages to be delivered to your loved one’s Apple Watch at regular times throughout the day or week. Whether it’s time to take medication or to visit a friend, help them structure their day on their own terms.\n\n**Communication**\nThe Apple Watch can make and receive phone calls, so you can check on your loved one in real time. It can even be set up to auto-answer calls, so you can start speaking to your loved one even if they’re not able to pick up themselves.\n\n**Easy to Use**\nEnjoy the intuitive interface, easy for both caregivers and loved ones to use. Loved ones wearing an Apple Watch running BoundaryCare don’t need to do anything at all, and caregivers can easily see key information on their dashboard.\n\n**Share the burden**\nBoundaryCare allows you to add as many caregivers as you want – for free. Create a caregiving group to share the responsibility.\n\n**Highly Individualized**\nCustomize settings to ensure that the app suits your individual needs. Take advantage of Apple Watch’s additional configuration features for your loved one – don’t leave them stuck with a stigmatizing and generic hardware of alternative alerting solutions.\n\n**Customer Support**\nOur dedicated team is always ready to assist you. Whenever you have a question or need help with the app, we're just a message away.\n\n**1 Month Free Trial**\nTry BoundaryCare free for one month to make sure it works for you. Afterwards, subscriptions start at $25/month, a much lower price than other leading alerting systems.\n \nBoundaryCare is more than just an app – it's a comprehensive platform designed to transform the way you care for your loved ones. By providing crucial support for those at high risk for falls or medical issues or living with dementia, ASD, or Down syndrome, BoundaryCare ensures that loved ones can enjoy their freedom and independence, while caregivers gain peace of mind. Why wait? Download BoundaryCare today and share the burden of caregiving.\n\nWebsite: www.boundarycare.com\n\nTerms of Service: https://www.boundarycare.com/terms-and-conditions\n\nDisclaimer: Continued use of location services while the app is in the background can drain the battery. BoundaryCare will never sell or share your sensitive data.", "bundleId":"com.BeatriceHealth.BoundaryCare", "userRatingCount":115}, 
